cff-version: 1.2.0
title: A construction cost escalation index for data centres in the United States
message: If you use this index or code, please cite the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dutta
    given-names: Sweta
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0007-2162-3564
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/dutta-sweta/dcci-index
abstract: >-
  Code and public data for a monthly fixed-weight Laspeyres input-cost index for
  data-centre construction in the United States, 2005-2026, with escalation
  decomposition, an office-index drift test, and a forecast benchmark.
keywords:
  - construction cost index
  - data centre
  - producer price index
  - Laspeyres index
  - time-series forecasting
